# REVIEWS.io

> REVIEWS.io is an ecommerce-focused review collection and reputation management platform. It enables brands to collect verified Product and Company reviews, gather user-generated content (photos & videos), optimize conversion with on-site social proof, and improve paid search performance with Google Seller Ratings.

REVIEWS.io operates in the ecommerce review software category and integrates deeply with Shopify, Shopify Plus, Magento, BigCommerce, WooCommerce, and custom ecommerce stacks via REST API.

REVIEWS.io also offers a loyalty and referrals platform called Influence.io, enabling brands to create loyalty programs, VIP tiers, referral campaigns, memberships, and rewards-based engagement programs.

---

## Features

- [Review Collection](https://www.reviews.io/front/review-collection): Automated email and SMS review invitations with customizable branding, segmentation, targeting controls, and AI-powered review management tools.

- [Product Reviews](https://www.reviews.io/front/productreviews): Verified product-level reviews with SEO-friendly structured data, rich snippets, and customizable display widgets.

- [Company Reviews](https://www.reviews.io/front/company-reviews): Brand-level review collection and response management tools.

- [Google Seller Ratings](https://www.reviews.io/front/google-seller-ratings): Enables seller rating stars to appear in Google Ads and Shopping results.

- [Reputation Management](https://www.reviews.io/front/reputation-management): Tools for managing reputation across multiple review platforms to maintain strong, consistent ratings and online trust.

- [Flow Review Collection](https://www.reviews.io/front/flow-review-collection): Multi-step review invitation workflows allowing segmentation by purchase behavior, geography, or custom attributes.

- [UGC (Photos & Videos)](https://www.reviews.io/front/ugc): Collection and display of user-generated visual content, including review photos and videos.

- [Social Proof](https://www.reviews.io/front/social-proof): Social proof visuals based on collected reviews and UGC, designed to increase trust and engagement on ecommerce storefronts.

- [Review Nuggets](https://www.reviews.io/front/review-nuggets): Highlighted review excerpts placed near key conversion areas.

- [Attributes](https://www.reviews.io/front/attributes): Structured review data such as quality, fit, delivery performance, and other custom metrics.

- [AI Review Assistant](https://www.reviews.io/front/ai-review-assistant): AI-assisted tools for review analysis, response suggestions, and insight generation.

- [Surveys](https://www.reviews.io/front/surveys): Pre- and post-purchase surveys, including Net Promoter Score (NPS) and structured customer feedback reporting.

